{"id":"sh/rm1k7yt4","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":64,"top":148,"width":1152,"height":90},"text":"现有软件多停留在字帖临摹与分享，练习指导不足。\n手写笔已有 4096 级压感，丰富书写数据仍未得到充分利用。","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#D7E7EE","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/ql8jytsj","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":64,"top":300,"width":350,"height":40},"text":"反馈滞后","style":{"fontSize":31,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#BDE3B1","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/doj29oba","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":64,"top":348,"width":350,"height":126},"text":"一对多课堂批改周期长，\n问题笔画难以及时纠正，\n错误写法反复固化。","style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#D7E7EE","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/sna103ap","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":465,"top":300,"width":350,"height":40},"text":"评价主观","style":{"fontSize":31,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#BDE3B1","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/3ihk3et8","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":465,"top":348,"width":350,"height":126},"text":"缺少可量化的结构标准，\n“写得好不好”依赖感觉，\n练习者难以独立判断。","style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#D7E7EE","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/ih8ju9sn","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":866,"top":300,"width":350,"height":40},"text":"练习静态","style":{"fontSize":31,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#BDE3B1","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/kbm987y5","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":866,"top":348,"width":350,"height":126},"text":"字帖只能临摹对照，\n缺少针对个人问题的修改路径，\n练习效率低、容易放弃。","style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#D7E7EE","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/5cva1cfq","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":64,"top":533,"width":1152,"height":38},"text":"视觉模型带来的练习反馈","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#BDE3B1","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/i94r6xgz","kind":"textbox","name":"text","position":{"left":64,"top":586,"width":1152,"height":50},"text":"即时结构评分，公开量化标准，给出局部修改路径","style":{"fontSize":34,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#FFFFFF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0}
